  "description": "Conformance test 16 (remnant draws, \u00a79 Z2b). Dezoning (PlaceZone type 0, skipFunds) a cell under an empty (no configuration) 1 \u00d7 1 agricultural lot: OnDezone sets the current zone to the lot's zone (7) before CreateLotRemnants, and zones 7-9 re-create one 1 \u00d7 1 lot per cell through CreateLotToFaceRoad with an empty list -> one U(4) draw per cell. The grid already says 0, so CanCreateLot gives code 2 (not zoned) and no lot is recreated: one draw, no lot. Dezoning a cell under an empty 2 \u00d7 2 residential lot (zone 1): CreateLotRemnants uses the strip path with the explicit facing list {facing} -> no draw.",
